From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: qcs8550-ayn: enable SDHCI capabilities and rumble, fix PCIe WAKE# polarity, codec rail sleep modes and gamepad MCU supply, and drop the dead thermal-zone overrides

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-ayn-common.dtsi
